<title>UK: UK M4 grows final 9.5 pct in year to Dec.</title>
<headline>UK M4 grows final 9.5 pct in year to Dec.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following data on UK monetary aggregates for Dec -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY				     Dec    pvs reported</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (adjusted)		-0.3	-0.2</p>
<p>	 in year to date (adjusted)		 9.5	 9.6</p>
<p>    M4 in month	  (unadjusted)	    -0.1	 unch</p>
<p>    in year to date (unadjusted)		  9.4	 9.5</p>
<p>-- Rosemary Bennett +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
